CTECS – Complete Highway Engineering Tools Upgrade Based on Applicable MoRTH & IRC Standards

PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Deeply inspect the complete existing CTECS Tools Page, every calculator, all related screens, calculation engines, inputs, outputs, navigation, validation, saved records and QC modules.

Upgrade the existing Tools section into a comprehensive, professional, full-fledged Highway Engineering and Construction Toolkit for Indian National Highway and State Highway construction projects.

Use the applicable MoRTH Specifications for Road and Bridge Works, current applicable IRC Codes and Special Publications, approved project drawings, contract specifications, amendments, addenda and project Quality Assurance Plan (QAP).

Do not simply add more cards. Complete the engineering functionality inside every existing tool, identify missing tools, missing inputs, missing calculations, missing validation, missing outputs and missing reporting functions.

The system must be modular, extensible, accurate and suitable for actual highway construction site engineers, quality-control engineers, surveyors and project management teams.

